{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Why it's great</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience your favorite music like never before. The game reacts in real-time to any track you play, syncing the speed of incoming obstacles to the beat.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dazzling audio-reactive particles and neon lights bring your music to life.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stellar gameplay: Spin around the center to dodge abstract shapes. With varying speeds and patterns, every playthrough offers a fresh, unique challenge.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1350080/extras/1540242bafc69e72db9bad958f48e610.poster.avif?t=1773917421\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1350080/extras/1540242bafc69e72db9bad958f48e610.webm?t=1773917421\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1350080/extras/1540242bafc69e72db9bad958f48e610.mp4?t=1773917421\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>How do I load my music?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1. Select 'My Music' in the menu to mute the in-game soundtrack.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2. Play your favorite music on your computer \u2013 the game will sync to it instantly!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>How do I play multiplayer?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To add a new player, simply press any button on a connected controller.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1350080/extras/0633957c39f770db2805753ca65b96dd.poster.avif?t=1773917421\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1350080/extras/0633957c39f770db2805753ca65b96dd.webm?t=1773917421\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1350080/extras/0633957c39f770db2805753ca65b96dd.mp4?t=1773917421\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Chill or compete</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play your way: Relax with infinite lives in Casual Mode or push your limits in Hardcore Mode to climb the leaderboards. The difficulty adapts to your skill level.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Buy DLC</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get the DLC to unlock 9 additional levels, enjoy co-op for up to 6 players, and show your support for the game!</p>","achievements":{"total":0},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1350080?t=1773917421","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1350080/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1773917421","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1350080/f47aa339ac1c22f3ebab9348ba7301a298ffd612/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1773917421","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1350080/f47aa339ac1c22f3ebab9348ba7301a298ffd612/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1773917421","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen Co-op","id":39},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen","id":24},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Steam Leaderboards","id":25},{"description":"Remote Play Together","id":44}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Why it's great</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience your favorite music like never before. The game reacts in real-time to any track you play, syncing the speed of incoming obstacles to the beat.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dazzling audio-reactive particles and neon lights bring your music to life.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stellar gameplay: Spin around the center to dodge abstract shapes. With varying speeds and patterns, every playthrough offers a fresh, unique challenge.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1350080/extras/1540242bafc69e72db9bad958f48e610.poster.avif?t=1773917421\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1350080/extras/1540242bafc69e72db9bad958f48e610.webm?t=1773917421\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1350080/extras/1540242bafc69e72db9bad958f48e610.mp4?t=1773917421\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>How do I load my music?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1. Select 'My Music' in the menu to mute the in-game soundtrack.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2. Play your favorite music on your computer \u2013 the game will sync to it instantly!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>How do I play multiplayer?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To add a new player, simply press any button on a connected controller.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1350080/extras/0633957c39f770db2805753ca65b96dd.poster.avif?t=1773917421\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1350080/extras/0633957c39f770db2805753ca65b96dd.webm?t=1773917421\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1350080/extras/0633957c39f770db2805753ca65b96dd.mp4?t=1773917421\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Chill or compete</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play your way: Relax with infinite lives in Casual Mode or push your limits in Hardcore Mode to climb the leaderboards. The difficulty adapts to your skill level.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Buy DLC</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get the DLC to unlock 9 additional levels, enjoy co-op for up to 6 players, and show your support for the game!</p>","developers":["Mlyst"],"dlc":[1376930],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Free To Play","id":"37"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1350080/0d9f2a54e8a724c3e198831810dea32aeeca8451/header.jpg?t=1773917421","is_free":true,"legal_notice":"ABC: Audioreactive Beat Circle \u00a9 2020 Developed by Mlyst. All rights reserved. All other trademarks are properties of their respective owners.","linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1350080/834641/e81aa5a538eff9ea9a9fc39738579317b8d354da/1751225400/dash_av1.mpd?t=1740430934","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1350080/834641/e81aa5a538eff9ea9a9fc39738579317b8d354da/1751225400/dash_h264.mpd?t=1740430934","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1350080/834641/e81aa5a538eff9ea9a9fc39738579317b8d354da/17